umber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3214","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"469","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"mal","id":"469","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"24318","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79192","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]}]},{"sourceEpisodeNumber":22,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3214","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"469","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"mal","id":"469","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"24318","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79192","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]}]},{"sourceEpisodeNumber":23,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3214","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"469","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"mal","id":"469","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"24318","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79192","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[23]}]},{"sourceEpisodeNumber":24,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3214","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"469","episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"mal","id":"469","episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"24318","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79192","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[24]}]}]},"checkedAt":1793467551435,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":[{"title":"Being Chased Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"To add to Karin's problems, there is a new, loud mouth, transfer student who claims to be from a long generation of vampire hunters. Will he find out about Karin?!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305129.jpg"},{"title":"Being Discovered Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"Karin has an \"accident\" in the hallway. The hunter suspects Usui of being a vampire when the blood is found. How will Karin and Usui cover this up?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305130.jpg"},{"title":"Looking Back... Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"We get to see Anju and Karin's relationship. Anju has flashbacks of her childhood with Karin.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305131.jpg"},{"title":"Papa Is Very Embarrassing","synopsis":"Karin fails a test, so Usui tutors her. Karin's dad plays the over-protective dad, and embarrasses Karin by following them around.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305132.jpg"},{"title":"It`s Summer! It`s the Pool! It`s Embarrassing!","synopsis":"Winner invites Karin to a pool, so Karin decides to act really rude to him. Will her plan to be \"unattractive\" change Winner's views of her?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305133.jpg"},{"title":"My Big Brother Sure Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"Ren sets his sights on sucking Usui's mother's blood.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305134.jpg"},{"title":"Awakening Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"After trying to bite Usui, Karin feels like she betrayed him, and thinks that he hates her. Meanwhile, Ren is still after Usui's mom.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305135.jpg"},{"title":"Just the Two of Us Till Morning Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"Karin finally realizes her feelings for Usui. Maki stays over at Karin's house for the first time. How will the family react?!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305136.jpg"},{"title":"Elda Appears! Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"The Cultural Festival is coming up, but it's not all fun and games for Karin. New problems arise when her grandma (who looks 16 years old) awakens from her coffin.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305137.jpg"},{"title":"Elda`s Love Story Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"Elda is after Usui. We see Elda's past, and why she is so against human and vampires relationships.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305138.jpg"},{"title":"Farewell Elda, Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"Everybody is having fun at the cutural festival, except Karin who is worried about Usui getting his blood sucked by Elda. If Elda gets her way, all of Usui's feelings of love will be erased!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305139.jpg"},{"title":"Brother`s Secret Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"When Ren was 14, he was placed in a human all boys school, and had a roomate who got picked on a lot because of his girl characteristics. Just another worthless human to Ren, or was he?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305140.jpg"},{"title":"A Couple`s Eve Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"It's Christmas time. Karin tries to figure out the perfect gift for Usui, and if she should tell him her feelings.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/305141.jpg"},{"title":"This Is the First... It`s Embarrassing","synopsis":"Usui asks Karin on a date, ans she's estatic. Meanwhile Anju is becoming a vampire, and Maki is depressed over Winner- yet Karin is oblivious to both's unhappiness.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/389593.jpg"},{"title":"What Should I Do, This Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"Elda has discovered a way to make Karin a true vampire. What will Karin do? Will she choose to become a real one and be with her family. Or will she choose to stay a blood-maker and stay with Usui?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/389594.jpg"},{"title":"Embarrassed Like a Lost Child","synopsis":"Karin doesn't know where to go, so she wonders around aimlessly. The battle between Elda and The Vampire Hunter contines. Usui tries to reach Karin, but can't.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/389595.jpg"},{"title":"Farewell Is Embarrassing","synopsis":"Usui tells Karin to go be with her family, and Karin learns just how much her parents care.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/389596.jpg"},{"title":"It Is Embarrassing to Be Together Always","synopsis":"The final episode in Karin. Will Karin become a normal vampire? Will her family be able to escape the wrath of the vampire hunter? Will it be a happy ending?! Watch it to find out!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79192/389597.jpg"}],"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
